Being Human is a drama, comedy, fantasy film directed by Bill Forsyth.

3
00:22:52,500 --> 00:22:58,500
One man must learn the meaning of courage across four lifetimes centuries apart.

4
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:36,000
Hector, played by Robin Williams.

5
00:38:07,500 --> 00:38:13,500
The Storyteller, played by Theresa Russell.

6
00:45:45,000 --> 00:45:51,000
Bambina, played by Maudie Johnson.

7
